{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 4 Special Detailed Requirements Based on Use and Occupancy Sections 401 to 402. {As in IBC} Section 403. High-Rise Buildings Sections 404 to 418. {As in IBC} Section 419. Artificial decorative vegetation Sections 420 to 428. {As in IBC} Sections 429 to 431. {Reserved} Section 432. Circuses and Carnivals Section 433. Chesapeake Bay Critical Area Development", "num": "4", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|II|4", "title": "Chapter 4 Special Detailed Requirements Based on Use and Occupancy", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/II/4"}
