{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/II/1015", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 1015. Guards 1015.1 to 1015.3 {As in IBC} 1015.4 Opening limitations. {As in IBC} Exceptions: {As in IBC} 1015.4.1 Residential occupancies. For occupancies in Use Group R, required guards may not be constructed with horizontal rails or any ornamental pattern that results in a ladder effect. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "1015", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|II|10|1015", "title": "Section 1015. Guards", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/II/1015"}
