{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 15 Roof Assemblies and Rooftop Structures Section 1501. General {As in IBC} Section 1502. Roof Drainage Section 1503. {As in IBC} Section 1504. Performance Requirements Sections 1505 to 1510. {As in IBC} Section 1511. Rooftop Structures Section 1512. {As in IBC}", "num": "15", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|II|15", "title": "Chapter 15 Roof Assemblies and Rooftop Structures", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/II/15"}
