{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 3105. Awnings and Canopies 3105.1 General. Awnings and canopies must comply with the requirements of: 1. this section, 2. other applicable sections of this article , and 3. the laws {, rules,} and regulations governing minor privilege permits. 3105.2 Design and construction. {As in IBC} 3105.3 Awning and canopy materials. {As in IBC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "3105", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|II|31|3105", "title": "Section 3105. Awnings and Canopies", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/II/3105"}
