{"body": "Baltimore City Code Appendix H Signs Sections H101 to H102. {As in IBC} Section H103. Location H103.1 Location restrictions \u2013 General. {As in IBC} H103.2 Location restrictions \u2013 Charles Street corridor. On either side of Charles Street from Baltimore Street to Mount Royal Avenue, no sign may extend or project more than 8 inches (203.2 mm) beyond the building wall proper. Sections H104 to H111. {As in IBC} Section H112. Projecting Signs H112.1 to H112.5 {As in IBC} H112.6 Clearance. A vertical clearance of 10 feet (3.05m) must be maintained below each projecting sign. Sections H113 to H115. {As in IBC}", "num": "H", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|II|attachments|H", "title": "Appendix H Signs", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/II/attachments/H"}
