{"body": "Baltimore City Code Part III National Electrical Code \u00a7 3-101. City adoption \u00a7 3-102. City modifications. Introduction \u00a7\u00a7 90.5 \u2013 90.5 Chapter 1 General \u00a7\u00a7 100.1 \u2013 110.34 Chapter 2 Wiring and Protection \u00a7\u00a7 210.5 \u2013 250.68 Chapter 3 Wiring Methods and Materials \u00a7\u00a7 334.30 \u2013 386.61 Chapter 4 Equipment for General Use \u00a7\u00a7 422.47 \u2013 422.47 Chapter 5 Special Occupancies \u00a7\u00a7 525.21 \u2013 525.22 Chapter 6 Special Equipment \u00a7\u00a7 600.6 \u2013 695.12 Chapter 7 Special Conditions \u00a7\u00a7 700.12 \u2013 702.13 Chapter 8 Communications Systems [As in NEC] Chapter 9 Tables [As in NEC] Attachments", "num": "III", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III", "title": "Part III National Electrical Code", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/3-101", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 3-101. City adoption (a) In general. The National Electrical Code (2020 Edition) is adopted as part of the Building, Fire, and Related Codes of Baltimore City, subject to the additions, deletions, amendments, and other modifications contained in this Part III. (b) Codification. Unless otherwise specified, chapter, article, and section numbers in this Part III refer to the chapter, article, and section numbers of the National Electrical Code. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "3-101", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|3-101", "title": "\u00a7 3-101. City adoption", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/3-101"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/3-102", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 3-102. City modifications. The additions, deletions, amendments, and other modifications adopted by the City are as follows: ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "3-102", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|3-102", "title": "\u00a7 3-102. City modifications.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/3-102"}
