{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 100.1. In general Except as provided in \u00a7 100.2 of this Code, terms that are used in these regulations and defined in the National Electrical Code (2020 Edition) have the meanings given in that Code. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "100.1", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|1|100|100.1", "title": "Section 100.1. In general", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/100.1"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/100.2", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 100.2. Supplemental Definitions (A) In general. Notwithstanding any different definition in the NEC, the following terms have the meanings given in this \u00a7 100.2. (B) Authority Having Jurisdiction. \"Authority Having Jurisdiction\" means the Building Official, as defined in \u00a7 202.2 of the Baltimore City Building Code . ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "100.2", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|1|100|100.2", "title": "Section 100.2. Supplemental Definitions", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/100.2"}
