{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 210.11. Branch Circuits Required. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC} (A) - (B) {As in NEC} (C) Dwelling Units. (1) - (4) {As in NEC} (5) Window Air Conditioner Branch Circuits. A circuit for a cord-connected window air conditioner must contain a dedicated receptacle. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "210.11", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|2|210|210.11", "title": "Section 210.11. Branch Circuits Required. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/210.11"}
