{"body": "Baltimore City Code Article 230 Services Section 230.1. Scope. {As in NEC} Section 230.2. Number of Services. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC} Sections 230.3 to 230.23. {As in NEC} Section 230.24. Clearances. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC} Sections 230.26 to 230.33. {As in NEC} Section 230.40. Number of Service-Entrance Conductor Sets. Each service drop or lateral may supply only 1 set of service-entrance conductors. Sections 230.41 to 230.84. {As in NEC} Section 230.85. {As in NEC} Sections 230.86 to 230.212. {As in NEC}", "num": "230", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|2|230", "title": "Article 230 Services", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/2/230"}
