{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/250.52", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 250.52. Grounding Electrodes. (A) Electrodes Permitted for Grounding. {As in NEC} (B) Not Permitted for Use as Grounding Electrodes. The following may not be used as grounding electrodes: (1) Gas piping or any other metallic piping or tank that contains flammable liquids (2) {As in NEC} (3) {As in NEC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "250.52", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|2|250|250.52", "title": "Section 250.52. Grounding Electrodes.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/250.52"}
