{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 3 Wiring Methods and Materials Articles 300 to 332 [As in NEC] Article 334 Nonmetallic-Sheathed Cable: Types NM, NMC, and NMS \u00a7\u00a7 334.30 \u2013 334.30 Articles 336 to 384 [As in NEC] Article 386 Surface Metal Raceways \u00a7\u00a7 386.61 \u2013 386.61 Articles 388 to 399 [As in NEC]", "num": "3", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|3", "title": "Chapter 3 Wiring Methods and Materials", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/3"}
