{"body": "Baltimore City Code Article 386 Surface Metal Raceways Sections 386.1 to 386.60. {As in NEC} Section 386.61. Equipment Grounding Conductor. In all occupancies, receptacle outlets supplied by a surface metal raceway must contain an equipment grounding conductor within the raceway. Sections 386.70 to 386.120. {As in NEC}", "num": "386", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|3|386", "title": "Article 386 Surface Metal Raceways", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/3/386"}
