{"body": "Baltimore City Code Article 525 Carnivals, Circuses, Fairs, and Similar Events. Sections 525.1 to 525.20. {As in NEC} Section 525.21. Rides, Tents, and Concessions. Section 525.22. Portable Distribution or Termination Boxes. Portable distribution or termination boxes must comply with all of the requirements of this \u00a7 525.22. Sections 525.23 to 525.32. {As in NEC}", "num": "525", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|5|525", "title": "Article 525 Carnivals, Circuses, Fairs, and Similar Events.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/5/525"}
