{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/525.21", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 525.21. Rides, Tents, and Concessions. (A) - (B) {As in NEC} (C) Electrical Lamps. Electrical fixtures must be so installed that lamps are kept at least 8 inches (203 mm) away from tent canvas or other combustible materials. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "525.21", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|5|525|525.21", "title": "Section 525.21. Rides, Tents, and Concessions.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/525.21"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/525.22", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 525.22. Portable Distribution or Termination Boxes. Portable distribution or termination boxes must comply with all of the requirements of this \u00a7 525.22. (A) - (D) {As in NEC} (E) Junction Boxes. Taps and connections within 8 feet (2.44 m) of the ground must be made in junction boxes that are kept locked at all times when the public is on the grounds. Metal junction boxes must be grounded. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "525.22", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|5|525|525.22", "title": "Section 525.22. Portable Distribution or Termination Boxes. Portable distribution or termination boxes must comply with all of the requirements of this \u00a7 525.22.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/525.22"}
