{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 600.6. Disconnects. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC} Exceptions: {As in NEC} (A) Location. (1) At Point of Entry to a Sign Enclosure. The disconnect shall be located at the point the feeder circuit or branch circuit(s) supplying a sign or outline lighting system enters a sign enclosure in accordance with \u00a7 600.5(C)(3) and shall disconnect all wiring where it enters the enclosure of the sign. Exceptions: (1) {Not Adopted} (2) {As in NEC} (2) - (4) {As in NEC} (B) Control Switch Rating. {As in NEC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "600.6", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|6|600|600.6", "title": "Section 600.6. Disconnects. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/600.6"}
