{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 695.3. Power Source(s) for Electric Motor-Driven Fire Pumps. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC} (A) - (C) {As in NEC} (D) On-Site Standby Generator as Alternate Source. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC} (1) Capacity. {As in NEC} (2) Connection. A tap ahead of the generator disconnecting means is required. (3) Adjacent Disconnects. The requirements of \u00a7 430.113 of this Code apply. (E) - (I) {As in NEC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "695.3", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|6|695|695.3", "title": "Section 695.3. Power Source(s) for Electric Motor-Driven Fire Pumps. {Introductory paragraph as in NEC}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/695.3"}
