{"body": "Baltimore City Code Article 702 Optional Standby Systems Sections 702.1 to 702.12. {As in NEC} Section 702.13. Portable Gasoline-Powered Generators. Where public utility service is available, a portable gasoline-powered generator may not be used in place of normal power source.", "num": "702", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|7|702", "title": "Article 702 Optional Standby Systems", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/7/702"}
