{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/702.13", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 702.13. Portable Gasoline-Powered Generators. Where public utility service is available, a portable gasoline-powered generator may not be used in place of normal power source. Exception : Where power is interrupted due to emergency conditions. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "702.13", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|III|7|702|702.13", "title": "Section 702.13. Portable Gasoline-Powered Generators. Where public utility service is available, a portable gasoline-powered generator may not be used in place of normal power source.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/III/702.13"}
