{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/IV/109", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 109. Fees {As in IFGC} 109.1 Payment of Fees. {As in IFGC} 109.2 Fee schedule. The fees for work are as set forth in \u00a7 109 {\"Fees\u201d} of the Baltimore City Building Code. 109.3 Permit valuations. {As in IFGC} 109.4 Work commencing before permit issuance. {Not Adopted} 109.5 Related fees. {As in IFGC} 109.6 Fee refunds. {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "109", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|IV|1|109", "title": "Section 109. Fees\n{As in IFGC}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/IV/109"}
