{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/IV/405", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 405. Piping Bends and Changes in Direction 405.1 General. Changes in direction of gas pipe may be made by the use of fittings. Factory bends or field bends are only permitted underground, in a location outside of any building. 405.2 to 405.4 {As in IFGC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "405", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|IV|4|405", "title": "Section 405. Piping Bends and Changes in Direction", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/IV/405"}
