{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/V/113", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 113. Administrative and Judicial Review 113.1 General. A decision of the Code Official is subject to administrative and judicial review as provided in the Baltimore City Building Code. 113.2 to 113.4 {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "113", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|V|1|113", "title": "Section 113. Administrative and Judicial Review", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/V/113"}
