{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 7 Combustion Air [As in IMC]", "num": "7", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|V|7", "title": "Chapter 7 Combustion Air\n[As in IMC]", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/V/7"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/V/8", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 8 Chimneys and Vents Section 801. General Sections 802 to 806. {As in IMC}", "num": "8", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|V|8", "title": "Chapter 8 Chimneys and Vents", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/V/8"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/V/801", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 801. General 801.1 to 801.17 {As in IMC} 801.18 Existing chimneys and vents. {As in IMC} 801.18.1 to 801.18.4 {As in IMC} 801.18.5 Prohibited use. Masonry chimneys may not be used simultaneously as air duct chases and flue gas chases. 801.19 Multistory prohibited. {As in IMC} 801.20 Plastic vent joints. {As in IMC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "801", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|V|8|801", "title": "Section 801. General", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/V/801"}
