{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/115", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 115. Violations 115.1 to 115.3 {As in IPC} 115.4 Violation penalties. The penalties for a violation of this Code are as provided in \u00a7 114 {\"Violations\u201d} of the Baltimore City Building Code for a violation of that Code. 115.5 to 115.6 {As in IPC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "115", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|1|115", "title": "Section 115. Violations", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/115"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/116", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 116. Stop Work Order 116.1 Authority. The issuance and enforcement of stop-work orders are as provided in \u00a7 115 {\"Stop-Work Order\u201d} of the Baltimore City Building Code. 116.2 to 116.4 {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "116", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|1|116", "title": "Section 116. Stop Work Order", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/116"}
