{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 7 Sanitary Drainage Sections 701 to 707. {As in IPC} Section 708. Cleanouts Sections 709 to 718. {As in IPC}", "num": "7", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|7", "title": "Chapter 7 Sanitary Drainage", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/7"}
