{"body": "Baltimore City Code Sections 701 to 707. {As in IPC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "701 to 707", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|7|701to707", "title": "Sections 701 to 707. {As in IPC}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/701to707"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/708", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 708. Cleanouts 708.1 Cleanouts required. {As in IPC} 708.1.1 to 708.1.6 {As in IPC} 708.1.7 Manholes. {As in IPC} 708.1.7.1 DPW Guidelines. Manhole construction must comply with the Department of Public Work's guidelines and standards. 708.1.8 to 708.1.11 {As in IPC} 708.1.12 Ceiling spaces. Cleanouts are not permitted in ceiling spaces. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "708", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|7|708", "title": "Section 708. Cleanouts", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/708"}
