{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/9", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 9 Vents Sections 901 to 912. {As in IPC} Section 913. Waste Stack Vent Sections 914 to 920. {As in IPC}", "num": "9", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|9", "title": "Chapter 9 Vents", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/9"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/901to912", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Sections 901 to 912. {As in IPC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "901 to 912", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|9|901to912", "title": "Sections 901 to 912. {As in IPC}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/901to912"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/913", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 913. Waste Stack Vent 913.1 to 913.4 {As in IPC} 913.5 Permitted Fixtures. Lavatories, bathtubs, showers, water closets, urinals, kitchen sinks with or without food waste grinders, dishwashers, laundry sinks, clothes washer standpipes, drinking fountains, floor drains, and similar fixtures may be vented by a waste stack that is sized and installed in accordance with the requirements of this section. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "913", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|9|913", "title": "Section 913. Waste Stack Vent", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/913"}
