{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 10 Traps, Interceptors, and Separators Sections 1001 to 1002. {As in IPC} Section 1003. Interceptors and Separators Section 1004. Material, Joints, and Connections {As in IPC}", "num": "10", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VI|10", "title": "Chapter 10 Traps, Interceptors, and Separators", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VI/10"}
