{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 7 Fire Safety Requirements Section 701. General Section 702. Means of Egress {As in IPMC} Section 703. Fire-Resistance Ratings {As in IPMC} Section 704. Fire Protection Systems {As in IPMC} Section 705. Carbon Monoxide Alarms and Detection {As in IPMC}", "num": "7", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VII|7", "title": "Chapter 7 Fire Safety Requirements", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VII/7"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VII/701", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 701. General 701.1 Scope. {As in IPMC} 701.2 Responsibility. Except as provided in \u00a7 704 {\"Fire Protection Systems\"} of this Chapter, the owner and operator of the premises must provide and maintain fire safety facilities and equipment in compliance with these requirements. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "701", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VII|7|701", "title": "Section 701. General", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VII/701"}
