{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 2603. Fire Safety Requirements 2603.1 to 2603.7 {As in IFC} 2603.8 Sulfur candles prohibited. Except as specifically approved by the Fire Code Official, the use of sulfur candles for fumigating private residences is prohibited. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "2603", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|VIII|26|2603", "title": "Section 2603. Fire Safety Requirements", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/VIII/2603"}
