{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/112", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 112. Administrative and Judicial Review 112.1 General. A decision of the Building Official is subject to administrative and judicial review as provided in \u00a7 128 {\"Administrative and Judicial Review\"} of the Baltimore City Building Code . 112.2 to 112.4 {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "112", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|I|1|112", "title": "Section 112. Administrative and Judicial Review", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/112"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/113", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 113. Violations 113.1 to 113.3 {As in IRC} 113.4 Violation penalties. The penalties for a violation of this Code are as provided in \u00a7 114 {\"Violations\"} of the Baltimore City Building Code for a violation of that Code. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "113", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|I|1|113", "title": "Section 113. Violations", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/113"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/114", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 114. Stop-Work Order 114.1 General. The issuance and enforcement of stop-work orders are as provided in \u00a7 115 {\"Stop-Work Order\"} of the Baltimore City Building Code . 114.2 {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "114", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|I|1|114", "title": "Section 114. Stop-Work Order", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/114"}
