{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 319. Site Address 319.1 Address identification. Address identification must be provided and maintained for all buildings in accordance with: 1. International Building Code \u00a7 502 {\"Building Address\"}, and 2. City Code Article 26 , Subtitle 6 {\"Building Address Numbers\"}. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "319", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|III|3|319", "title": "Section 319. Site Address", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/319"}
