{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 13 General Mechanical System Requirements Section 1301. General Sections 1302 to 1308. {As in IRC}", "num": "13", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|V|13", "title": "Chapter 13 General Mechanical System Requirements", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/V/13"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/1301", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 1301. General 1301.1 Scope. {As in IRC} 1301.1.1 Flood-resistant installation. In flood hazard areas, mechanical appliances , equipment and systems must be located and installed in accordance with the Floodplain Management Code. 1301.2 to 1301.5 {As in IRC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "1301", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|V|13|1301", "title": "Section 1301. General", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/1301"}
