{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/1701", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 1701. General 1701.1 Scope. {As in IRC} 1701.2 Opening location. In flood hazard areas, combustion air openings must be located at or above the elevation required by the Floodplain Management Code. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "1701", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|V|17|1701", "title": "Section 1701. General", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/1701"}
