{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/1801", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 1801. General {As in IRC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "1801", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|V|18|1801", "title": "Section 1801. General\n{As in IRC}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/1801"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/1802", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 1802. Vent Components 1802.1 Draft hoods. Draft hoods must be located in the same room or space as the combustion air openings for the appliances. Exception: Draft hoods of saunas may not be located in the same room as the sauna. 1802.2 Vent dampers. {As in IRC} 1802.3 Draft regulators. {As in IRC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "1802", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|V|18|1802", "title": "Section 1802. Vent Components", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/1802"}
