{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 20 Boilers and Water Heaters Section 2001. Boilers Sections 2002 to 2006. {As in IRC}", "num": "20", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|V|20", "title": "Chapter 20 Boilers and Water Heaters", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/V/20"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/2001", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 2001. Boilers 2001.1 to 2001.3 {As in IRC} 2001.4 Flood-resistant installation. In flood hazard areas, boilers, water heaters, and their control systems must be located and installed in accordance with the Floodplain Management Code. ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "2001", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|V|20|2001", "title": "Section 2001. Boilers", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/2001"}
