{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 2101. Hydronic Piping Systems Installation 2101.1 General. {As in IRC} Table 2101.1 {As in IRC, except that polybutylene (PB) pipe and piping is not approved.} 2101.2 to 2101.10 {As in IRC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "2101", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|V|21|2101", "title": "Section 2101. Hydronic Piping Systems Installation", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/2101"}
