{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/3604", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 3604. Overhead Service and Service-Entrance Conductor Installation 3604.1 Clearances on buildings. {As in IRC} 3604.2 Vertical clearances. {As in IRC} 3604.2.1 Above roofs. {As in IRC} 3604.2.2 Vertical clearance from grade. {Introductory paragraph as in IRC} 1. - 3. {As in IRC} 4. Clearance above decks. Conductors must have a vertical clearance of at least 8 feet at the lowest point above the deck surface. 3604.3 to 3604.6 {As in IRC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "3604", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|VIII|36|3604", "title": "Section 3604. Overhead Service and Service-Entrance Conductor Installation", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/3604"}
