{"body": "Baltimore City Code Chapter 39 Power and Lighting Distribution Section 3901. Receptacle Outlets Sections 3902 to 3907. {As in IRC} Section 3908. Grounding Section 3909. Flexible Cords {As in IRC}", "num": "39", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|VIII|39", "title": "Chapter 39 Power and Lighting Distribution", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/VIII/39"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/3901", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 3901. Receptacle Outlets 3901.1 to 3901.6 {As in IRC} 3901.7 Outdoor outlets. {As in IRC} 3901.7.1 Near public walkways. A receptacle installed less than 10 feet from a public walkway must be wall-switch controlled from within the dwelling unit. 3901.7.2 Decks. At least 1 GFCI receptacle must be installed on all decks of whatever level. 3901.8 to 3901.12 {As in IRC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "3901", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|VIII|39|3901", "title": "Section 3901. Receptacle Outlets", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/3901"}
