{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/3908", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 3908. Grounding 3908.1 to 3908.7 {As in IRC} 3908.8 Types of equipment grounding conductors. {Introductory paragraph as in IRC} 1. - 8. {As in IRC} 9. Surface metal raceways that are listed for grounding and that contain equipment grounding conductors within the raceway. 3908.8.1 to 3908.8.3 {As in IRC} 3908.9 to 3908.20 {As in IRC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "3908", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|VIII|39|3908", "title": "Section 3908. Grounding", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/3908"}
