{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 4101. General 4101.1 to 4101.4 {As in IRC} 4101.5 Disconnecting means generally. {As in IRC} 4101.5.1 Water Heaters. Circuits that supply water heaters must have a disconnecting means other than the overcurrent device. This disconnecting means must be installed close to the water heater. 4101.6 to 4101.8 {As in IRC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "4101", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|X|VIII|41|4101", "title": "Section 4101. General", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/X/4101"}
