{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 801.4. Prescriptive option 801.4.1 Day lighting. 801.4.1.1 Daylighting in large spaces directly under a roof and having high ceilings. {As in IgCC} 801.4.1.1.1 through 801.4.1.1.3 {Not Adopted} 801.4.2 Materials. {As in IgCC} 801.4.2.1 Adhesives and Sealants. {As in IgCC} 801.4.2.2 Paints and Coatings. {As in IgCC} 801.4.2.3 Floor Covering Materials. {As in IgCC} 801.4.2.3.1 Deemed to Comply. {As in IgCC} 801.4.2.4 Composite Wood, Wood Structural Panel, and Agrifiber Products. {As in IgCC} 801.4.2.5 Office Furniture Systems and Seating. {Not Adopted} 801.4.2.6 Ceiling and Wall Assemblies. {Not Adopted} 801.4.2.7 Insulation. {Not Adopted} 801.4.3 Lighting for Presentations. {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "801.4", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|XI|8|801.4", "title": "Section 801.4. Prescriptive option", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/XI/801.4"}
