{"body": "Baltimore City Code 108. Fees {As in ISPSC} 108.1 Fees. {As in ISPSC} 108.2 Fee schedule. The fees for work are set forth in \u00a7 109 {\"Fees\u201d} of the Baltimore City Building Code. 108.3 Permit Valuation. {As in ISPSC} 108.4 to 108.6 {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "108", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|XII|1|108", "title": "108. Fees\n{As in ISPSC}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/XII/108"}
