{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/XII/113", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 113. Violations 113.1 to 113.3 {As in ISPSC} 113.4 Violation penalties. The penalties for a violation of this Code are as provided in \u00a7 114 {\"Violations\"} of the Baltimore City Building Code for a violation of that Code. 113.5 to 113.6 {As in ISPSC} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "113", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|XII|1|113", "title": "Section 113. Violations", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/XII/113"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/XII/114", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code 114. Stop Work Order 114.1 Authority. The issuance and enforcement of stop-work orders are provided for in \u00a7 115 {\"Stop-work order\u201d} of the Baltimore City Building Code. 114.2 to 114.4 {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "114", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|XII|1|114", "title": "114. Stop Work Order", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/XII/114"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/XII/115", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Section 115. Administrative and Judicial Review 115.1 General. A decision of the Code Official is subject to administrative and judicial review as provided for in the Baltimore City Building Code . 115.2 to 115.7 {Not Adopted} ( Ord. 24-341 .)", "num": "115", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|building-codes|XII|1|115", "title": "Section 115. Administrative and Judicial Review", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/building-codes/XII/115"}
