{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-101. In general. Throughout the Baltimore City Code, the following terms have the meanings indicated, except as otherwise expressly provided. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-101", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-101", "title": "\u00a7 1-101. In general.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-101"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-102", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-102. Adult. \"Adult\" means an individual who is 18 years or older. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-102", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-102", "title": "\u00a7 1-102. Adult.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-102"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-103", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-103. City. \"City\" means the City of Baltimore. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-103", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-103", "title": "\u00a7 1-103. City.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-103"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-104", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-104. City Code; Code. \"City Code\" or \"Code\" means: (1) the numbered articles of the Baltimore City Code; and (2) the unnumbered articles of the Revised Code of Baltimore City. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-104", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-104", "title": "\u00a7 1-104. City Code; Code.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-104"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-105", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-105. Includes; Including. \"Includes\" or \"including\" means by way of illustration and not by way of limitation. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-105", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-105", "title": "\u00a7 1-105. Includes; Including.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-105"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-106", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-106. Minor. \"Minor\" means an individual under the age of 18. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-106", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-106", "title": "\u00a7 1-106. Minor.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-106"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-107", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-107. Person. (a) In general. \"Person\" means: (1) an individual; (2) a receiver, trustee, guardian, personal representative, fiduciary, or representative of any kind; or (3) a partnership, firm, association, corporation, or other entity of any kind. (b) Exclusion. \"Person\" does not include, except as otherwise expressly provided, a governmental entity or an instrumentality or unit of a governmental entity. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-107", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-107", "title": "\u00a7 1-107. Person.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-107"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-108", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-108. State. (a) Lower case. Except as provided in subsection (b) of this section, \"state\" means: (1) a state, possession, territory, or commonwealth of the United States; or (2) the District of Columbia. (b) Capitalized. When capitalized, \"State\" means Maryland. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-108", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-108", "title": "\u00a7 1-108. State.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-108"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-109", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-109. Street. \"Street\" means any street, boulevard, road, highway, alley, lane, sidewalk, footway, or other way that is owned by the City or habitually used by the public. (Ord. 21-017.)", "num": "1-109", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|general|1|1|1-109", "title": "\u00a7 1-109. Street.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1-109"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/general/1/2", "_type": "page"}}
