{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 1-101. In general. In this article , the following terms have the meanings indicated. (Ord. 99-548.)", "num": "1-101", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|health|1|1|1-101", "title": "\u00a7 1-101. In general.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/health/1-101"}
