{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/health/2", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Title 2 Department of Health Subtitle 1 Organization and General Authority \u00a7\u00a7 2-101 \u2013 2-107 Subtitle 2 Cooperation with Department \u00a7\u00a7 2-201 \u2013 2-213 Subtitle 3 Administrative Hearings \u00a7\u00a7 2-301 \u2013 2-307", "num": "2", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|health|2", "title": "Title 2 Department of Health", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/health/2"}
