{"body": "Baltimore City Code 17-2 to 17-5. {Reserved}", "num": "17-2 to 17-5", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|1|17-2to17-5", "title": "17-2 to 17-5. {Reserved}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-2to17-5"}
