{"body": "Baltimore City Code Part 2 Prohibited Conduct \u00a7 17-6. Using ticket purchasing software. \u00a7 17-7. Resale of tickets obtained by using ticket purchasing software. \u00a7 17-8. Maintaining interest in or control of ticket purchasing software. 17-9 to 17-10. {Reserved}", "num": "2", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|2", "title": "Part 2 Prohibited Conduct", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17/2"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-6", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 17-6. Using ticket purchasing software. No person may use ticket purchasing software to purchase tickets. (Ord. 16-545.)", "num": "17-6", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|2|17-6", "title": "\u00a7 17-6. Using ticket purchasing software.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-6"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-7", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 17-7. Resale of tickets obtained by using ticket purchasing software. No person may resell or offer to resell a ticket that the person knows was obtained by using ticket purchasing software. (Ord. 16-545.)", "num": "17-7", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|2|17-7", "title": "\u00a7 17-7. Resale of tickets obtained by using ticket purchasing software.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-7"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-8", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 17-8. Maintaining interest in or control of ticket purchasing software. No person may intentionally maintain any interest in or control of ticket purchasing software. (Ord. 16-545.)", "num": "17-8", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|2|17-8", "title": "\u00a7 17-8. Maintaining interest in or control of ticket purchasing software.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-8"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-9to17-10", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code 17-9 to 17-10. {Reserved}", "num": "17-9 to 17-10", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|2|17-9to17-10", "title": "17-9 to 17-10. {Reserved}", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-9to17-10"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17/3", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code Part 3 Enforcement \u00a7 17-11. Prepayable citation. \u00a7 17-12. Criminal penalties.", "num": "3", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|3", "title": "Part 3 Enforcement", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17/3"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-11", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 17-11. Prepayable citation. (a) In general. In addition to any other civil or criminal remedy or enforcement procedure, this subtitle may be enforced by issuance of: (1) an environmental citation under City Code Article 1 , Subtitle 40 {\"Environmental Control Board\"}; or (2) a civil citation under City Code Article 1 , Subtitle 41 {\"Civil Citations\"}. (b) Process not exclusive. The issuance of a citation to enforce this subtitle does not preclude pursuing any other civil or criminal remedy or enforcement action authorized by law. (Ord. 16-545.)", "num": "17-11", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|3|17-11", "title": "\u00a7 17-11. Prepayable citation.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-11"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-12", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 17-12. Criminal penalties. (a) In general. Any person who violates any provision of this subtitle is guilty of a misdemeanor and, on conviction, is subject to: (1) a fine of not more than $500 or imprisonment for not more than 90 days or both fine and imprisonment for each offense; (2) forfeiture of all profits from the sale of tickets obtained in violation of this subtitle; and (3) forfeiture of any equipment used to purchase tickets in violation of this subtitle. (b) Each ticket a separate offense. Each ticket purchased, resold, or offered for resale in violation of this subtitle is a separate offense. (Ord. 16-545.)", "num": "17-12", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|2|17|3|17-12", "title": "\u00a7 17-12. Criminal penalties.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/2/17-12"}
