{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 11-23. Railroad District. The properties known as 902-920 and 905-915 Lemmon Street are declared to be the Railroad Historic District. (Ord. 15-408; Ord. 03-486; Ord. 00-108.) Prior Codifications City Code, 2000, art. 6, \u00a7 7-23", "num": "11-23", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|6|11|11-23", "title": "\u00a7 11-23. Railroad District.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/6/11-23"}
