{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 14-3. Carroll Hunting Lodge. \"Carroll Hunting Lodge,\" located at 5914 Greenspring Avenue, Ward 27, Section 22, Block 4400B, Lot 2. (Ord. 15-408; Ord. 82-829.) Prior Codifications 2000, art. 6, \u00a710-3 City Code, 1976/83, art. 1, \u00a740(ff)(57)", "num": "14-3", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|6|14|14-3", "title": "\u00a7 14-3. Carroll Hunting Lodge.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/6/14-3"}
