{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 14-4. Continental Building. Continental Building, located at 201 East Baltimore Street, Ward 4, Section 11, Block 650, Lot 4. (Ord. 15-408; Ord. 82-829.) Prior Codifications 2000, art. 6, \u00a710-4 City Code, 1976/83, art. 1, \u00a740(ff)(58)", "num": "14-4", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|6|14|14-4", "title": "\u00a7 14-4. Continental Building.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/6/14-4"}
