{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 14-13. New Psalmist Baptist Church and Parsonage. New Psalmist Baptist Church and Parsonage, located at 100 West Franklin Street, Ward 11, Section 10, Block 550, Lot 1. (Ord. 15-408; Ord. 82-829.) Prior Codifications 2000, art. 6, \u00a710-13 City Code, 1976/83, art. 1, \u00a740(ff)(67)", "num": "14-13", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|6|14|14-13", "title": "\u00a7 14-13. New Psalmist Baptist Church and Parsonage.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/6/14-13"}
