{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 14-19. Fort McHenry. Fort McHenry, located at 1401 Constellation Plaza, Lot 1 in Block 24-11-2058A, having an area of 43.61 acres, more or less. (Ord. 15-408; Ord. 86-851.) Prior Codifications 2000, art. 6, \u00a710-19 City Code, 1976/83, art. 1, \u00a740(ff)(73)", "num": "14-19", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|6|14|14-19", "title": "\u00a7 14-19. Fort McHenry.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/6/14-19"}
