{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 14-20. G. Krug and Sons. G. Krug and Sons, 415-417 West Saratoga Street, Lot 23, Block 4-5-595, measuring 45 by 80 feet, more or less. (Ord. 15-408; Ord. 86-851.) Prior Codifications 2000, art. 6, \u00a710-20 City Code, 1976/83, art. 1, \u00a740(ff)(74)", "num": "14-20", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|6|14|14-20", "title": "\u00a7 14-20. G. Krug and Sons.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/6/14-20"}
