{"body": "Baltimore City Code Part 4 [Repealed] 59-41 to 59-60. {Repealed by Ord. 02-452.}", "num": "4", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|19|59|4", "title": "Part 4 [Repealed]", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/19/59/4"}
