{"body": "Baltimore City Code Article 22 Retirement Systems Subtitle 1 Employees' Retirement System \u00a7\u00a7 1 \u2013 17.3 Subtitle 2 Elected Officials' Retirement System \u00a7\u00a7 17A \u2013 27 Subtitle 3 Fire and Police Employees' Retirement System \u00a7\u00a7 29 \u2013 41A Subtitle 4 Contractual Provisions \u00a7\u00a7 42 \u2013 42 Subtitle 5 Investment Advisors \u00a7\u00a7 43 \u2013 43 Subtitle 6 Police Department, Special Fund \u00a7\u00a7 44 \u2013 45 Subtitle 7 General Provisions \u00a7\u00a7 46 \u2013 49", "num": "22", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|22", "title": "Article 22 Retirement Systems", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/22"}
