{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 31-74. \"D\" streets and areas. (1) Dolphin Street, both sides, from Madison Avenue to Eutaw Place. (2) Druid Hill Avenue, both sides, from Eutaw Street to Fulton Avenue. (Ord. 66-821; Ord. 65-580.) Prior Codifications 1976/83, art. 31, \u00a7104 City Code, 1966, art. 31, \u00a7132", "num": "31-74", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|31|31|7|31-74", "title": "\u00a7 31-74. \"D\" streets and areas.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/31/31-74"}
