{"body": "Baltimore City Code \u00a7 11-301. As listed in Table 11-301. Only those uses of land listed in Table 11-301: Industrial Districts \u2013 Permitted and Conditional Uses are allowed within these zoning districts. (Ord. 17-015; Ord. 16-581.)", "num": "11-301", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|32|11|3|11-301", "title": "\u00a7 11-301. As listed in Table 11-301.", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/32/11-301"}
