s Facility 3 CB, P CB, P CB, P CB, P Per \u00a7 14-338 Utilities CB CB CB CB Per \u00a7 14-340 Wireless Communications Services 4 CB, P CB, P CB, P CB, P Per \u00a7 14-338 1 No recreation facilities are allowed, except for standard playground equipment and outdoor furniture. 2 Not to exceed 5,000 sq. ft. of the structure's gross floor area. 3 Only telecommunications base stations that comply with the stealth design standards of \u00a7 14-338 are considered permitted uses. 4 Only Wireless Communication Services that are modifications to \u2013 and do not substantially change the physical dimension of \u2013 an existing telecommunications facility, are considered permitted uses. (Ord. 22-181; Ord. 18-171; Ord. 17-015; Ord. 16-581.)", "num": "12-402", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|32|zoning-tables|12-402", "title": "Table 12-402 Transit-Oriented Development Districts \u2013 Permitted and Conditional Uses", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/32/zoning-tables/12-402"}
