d do not substantially change the physical dimension of \u2013 an existing telecommunications facility, are considered permitted uses. (Ord. 23-262; Ord. 22-181; Ord. 18-171; Ord. 17-015; Ord. 16-581.)", "num": "12-501", "path": "library|City of Baltimore, Md., Code|32|zoning-tables|12-501", "title": "Table 12-501 Educational Campus Districts \u2013 Permitted and Conditional Uses", "url": "/us/md/cities/baltimore/code/32/zoning-tables/12-501"}
